  "body": "We should give users some guidance on what they need to do to effectively back up and restore a synapse.\r\n\r\nOff the top of my head:\r\n* database\r\n* media repo\r\n* homeserver.yaml\r\n* log config, where present\r\n* signing key (maybe, but it's fine just to use a new one)\r\n\r\n",
